OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a cold and frosty start,
OL,6,Fit will be a largely fine and dry day
OL,7,Fwith plenty of sunshine, especially
OL,8,Facross England and Wales. Some showers
OL,9,Flikely near North Sea coasts. Cloudier
OL,10,Fwith showers in the far north. Feeling
OL,11,Fcold.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStaying largely dry with
OL,14,Flengthy clear spells across England
OL,15,Fand Wales and a fairly widespread
OL,16,Ffrost. Turning cloudier in the south
OL,17,Fovernight. Further showers for
OL,18,Fnorthern parts of Scotland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
