OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FLargely fine and dry for
OL,6,FEngland and Wales, although cloudier
OL,7,Fthan previous days. Cloudier in
OL,8,Fnorthern Scotland with some rain and
OL,9,Fhill snow. Showers reaching southwest
OL,10,FEngland later. Feeling cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
